     "translation": "Я прохожу, а не бежать{1.выполнять}."
    },
    {
     "input": "Ten cats came, including him.",
     "raw_cp866_hex": "84a5e1efe2ec20aaaee8a5aa20afe0a8e5aea4a8aba82c20a2aaabeee7a0ef20a5a3ae2e0d0a",
